// Example TRIPOLI-4 PWR pin cell with ECRASE priority, COMPOSITION, GEOMCOMP, and BOUNDARY_CONDITION.
LANG ENGLISH

GEOMETRY

TITLE PWR pin cell with UO2 fuel, Zircaloy cladding, and light water moderator

SURF 1 CYLZ 0.0 0.0 0.41     // Fuel outer radius
SURF 2 CYLZ 0.0 0.0 0.475    // Cladding outer radius
SURF 3 PLANEX -0.63          // Cell -X boundary
SURF 4 PLANEX  0.63          // Cell +X boundary
SURF 5 PLANEY -0.63          // Cell -Y boundary
SURF 6 PLANEY  0.63          // Cell +Y boundary
SURF 7 PLANEZ -10.0          // Cell -Z boundary
SURF 8 PLANEZ  10.0          // Cell +Z boundary

VOLU 1 EQUA PLUS 3 3 5 7 MINUS 3 4 6 8 ENDV // Water Moderator
VOLU 2 EQUA PLUS 1 7 MINUS 2 2 8 ECRASE 1 1 ENDV // Zircaloy Cladding
VOLU 3 EQUA PLUS 1 7 MINUS 2 1 8 ECRASE 1 2 ENDV // UO2 Fuel Pellet

ENDG

BOUNDARY_CONDITION
4
ALL_COMPLETE REFLECTION 3
ALL_COMPLETE REFLECTION 4
ALL_COMPLETE REFLECTION 5
ALL_COMPLETE REFLECTION 6
END_BOUNDARY_CONDITION

COMPOSITION
3
DENSITY 600 m1_uo2 10.4 NB_ATOM 2
  U235 0.04
  U238 0.96
DENSITY 600 m2_zirc4 6.55 NB_ATOM 2
  ZR90 0.985
  SN120 0.015
DENSITY 580 m3_water 0.74 NB_ATOM 2
  H1 2.0
  O16 1.0
END_COMPOSITION

GEOMCOMP
  m1_uo2   1 3
  m2_zirc4 1 2
  m3_water 1 1
END_GEOMCOMP

END
